go-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
  Vershinin, Konstantin V. “A Full Slavic Copy of the Commentary on the Psalms by Theodoret of Cyrrhus.” <title level="m">Palaeobulgarica</title> 42 (2018): 3–36.
